<h1>九、AI 实现关键注意事项</h1>
<ol>
  <li seq="auto">弹窗 z-index：全局 topZIndex，每次打开递增</li>
  <li seq="auto">表格内下拉：必须 position:fixed + getBoundingClientRect()</li>
  <li seq="auto">编码：UTF-8，严禁 PowerShell Get-Content 修改含中文 HTML</li>
  <li seq="auto">列宽拖拽：.col-resizer mousedown→mousemove→mouseup</li>
  <li seq="auto">Tab 切换：[data-tab] ↔ [data-pane] 联动</li>
  <li seq="auto">全选：表头复选框 → tbody 行复选框</li>
  <li seq="auto">级联多选下拉：原生 JS 父级联动子级（P4 用）</li>
  <li seq="auto">Status Tab：.status-tags 容器内 .status-tag 点击切换 .active</li>
  <li seq="auto">侧边栏更新：新增菜单需同步所有 11 个 HTML 文件</li>
  <li seq="auto">系统文件清单共 11 页：product-mapping / invoice-flow-config / index / invoice / invoice-nonstandard / invoice-edit / invoice-nonstandard-edit / invoice-detail / invoice-detail-nonstandard / verification / verification-trace</li>
</ol>
